  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Central Continent sky she wears a golden robe and stands with Qian Zhu Xian and Valley Lord Ming He after Shi Lei’s request for help. Valley Lord Ming He says they need her help to confirm the place. She closes her eyes, keeps a calm aura with no fluctuation, then opens them and names Starry Sky grotto-heaven at that spot. She is over nine hundred years old.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_shi_lei",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is beautiful and elegant. She wears a golden robe and radiates majesty and dignity.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among rank seven Gu Immortals she stands at two grand tribulations cultivation level, one level above Qian Zhu Xian and Valley Lord Ming He at one grand tribulation each. She reminds them that absorbing even a bit of a nine heavens fragment roots a grotto-heaven into the greater world’s aura so it can never return into the body. When the group moves to handle the task, Immortal Gu aura bursts from her robe; she opens her eyes, pierces a man-sized hole in the void, and follows her companions into Starry Sky grotto-heaven, only for all three to reappear in the sky as space interchanges. She judges the swap a mystical ability from the blue heaven fragment and calls it only a minor problem.",
      "chapters": [
        740
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribulation-standing-and-entry",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
